---
// Heading on the left, eight customer logos in a bordered 4x2 grid of cells on the right.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg sm:text-4xl">The teams behind good work plan it in Halcyon</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted">From four-person studios to fifty-person product teams, more than 4,200 companies run their week here.</p>
      <a href="/about" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 dark:text-brand-400 dark:hover:text-brand-300">
        <span>Read their stories</span>
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14" />
          <path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line bg-line lg:col-span-2">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-px sm:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-northwind.svg" alt="Northwind" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-lumina.svg" alt="Lumina" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-kestrel.svg" alt="Kestrel" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-fathom.svg" alt="Fathom" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-juniper.svg" alt="Juniper" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-quanta.svg" alt="Quanta" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-solstice.svg" alt="Solstice" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center bg-bg px-6">
          <img src="/media/logo-meridian.svg" alt="Meridian" height="28" class="h-7 w-auto opacity-70" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
